config ISH_CHRE
	bool "Use CHRE on ISH"
	help
	  Enable the Context Hub Runtime Environment (CHRE) on Intel ISH.
	  CHRE is an event-driven runtime architecture designed for low-power,
	  always-on contextual computing such as sensor fusion, activity
	  recognition, and nanoapps.
